      "ordinal": 1,
      "prompt": "A polling organization computes a 95% confidence interval for a population proportion. If it increases the sample size while keeping the confidence level and sample proportion the same, what happens to the margin of error?\n(A) It increases.\n(B) It decreases.\n(C) It stays the same.\n(D) It doubles.",
